  (text "Notes\nJ1: GND VBAT EN(33) RX(14): a straight XH 4 lead from the carrier's J13\nR1: Off through sleep and reset\nR3: Holds Q1 off\nC3: Soft start, about 0.4 ms\nU1: Boost to 5.1 V; EN tied to IN, Q1 does the switching\nR6: V5 = 0.6 V x (1 + 680k / 100k)\nU2: Its +5 V output to 0V; -5 V (pin 4) unconnected\nU5: INB to OUTB carries the sensor's serial line; side 1 from GPIO 33; the I2C channels unused, held high\nR16: INB low with no sensor\nR18: Ranging pin high\nJ2: MB7569 pin 6 V+, pin 7 GND, pin 5 serial out, pin 4 ranging" (at 20 225 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 91e65a7a-f04f-58fd-9265-bc49288eca63))
